 23\n\n    Balboa Park\, San Diego (near 6th and Quince) Starts on the West
  side of Balboa Park on 6th Avenue at the corner of Maple.\n    Elem Stude
 nts who run this race will also get 30 running club sticks! If you are mot
 ivated by the sticks but would rather not purchase registration\, then run
  3 miles in Balboa Park on your own that weekend & get a parent signature 
 that you ran.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
