 sting on Wednesday afternoons (while testing supplies last).&nbsp\;<br><br
 ><b>This testing is OPTIONAL and is only open to AEA students and staff me
 mbers.</b>&nbsp\;<ul><li>OPTIONAL Covid testing day will be every Wednesda
 y between 1:00pm – 3:00pm.</li><li>Available only to AEA students and st
 aff members.</li><li>Parent consent is required prior to testing.</li><li>
 Masks are mandatory.</li><li>Testing is performed via a rapid antigen test
  (nasal swab) and is self-administered (student will swab themselves with 
 guidance from an AEA staff member).</li><li>Tests will be administered and
  then you will be asked to leave. You will receive electronic notification
  of results. There will be absolutely NO congregate waiting at the testing
  site.</li></ul>&nbsp\;<br><b>LOCATIONS:&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><ul><li>Elementa
 ry – 3035 Ash Street (front of school)</li><li>Middle – 458 26th Stree
 t (athletic courts – back of school)</li></ul>&nbsp\;<br><b><u>IMPORTANT
