RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;WKST=SU;UNTIL=20240320T065959Z;BYDAY=TU
DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr">Albert Einstein Academies is excited to begin offe
 ring in-person tours of our school campuses for prospective families. Each
  tour will run for approximately 30-60 minutes and will take you through o
 ur entire school campus. Unfortunately\, we will not be able to bring atte
 ndees directly into active classrooms during the school day. To attend\, y
 ou must RSVP for a specific tour date and time. </p><br><p dir="ltr">Thes
 e tours are intended for adults only\, please do not bring children. We as
 k that only one member of your family attend the tour due to limited avail
 ability.</p><br><p dir="ltr">Health and Safety</p><ul><li dir="ltr"><p dir
 ="ltr">All visitors must be free from <a href="https://www.google.com/url?
 q=https://www.cdc.gov/coronavirus/2019-ncov/symptoms-testing/symptoms.html
