 pi3oy38biG2u_T6EoFpeK" target="_blank"><u>COVID-19 symptoms.</u></a></p></
 li><li dir="ltr"><p dir="ltr">All visitors are highly recommended to wear 
 a mask while on campus.</p></li><li dir="ltr"><p dir="ltr">Each attendee w
 ill be asked to check in via our front desk system which performs a routin
 e background check and issues an identification badge. </p></li><li dir="
 ltr"><p dir="ltr">At all times display your visitor identification badge d
 uring your visit. </p></li></ul><br>All tour options and RSVP links are a
 vailable on the <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.aeacs.or
 g/school-tours&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1705942372343344&am
 p\;usg=AOvVaw3aPUx9H8n5KmC0vLco8e2Z" target="_blank"><u>AEA website under 
 the Enrollment menu</u></a>.
